learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:1: trailing whitespace.
+Feature: Expired readiness cannot authorize synthetic promotion
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:2: trailing whitespace.
+  A-S086 is one frozen S unit in SC-S086, parent D-S086.
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:3: trailing whitespace.
+  Training rehearsal - synthetic data - not a live Azure result
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:4: trailing whitespace.
+  The two-tick lifetime is an invented exercise bound, not an Azure threshold.
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:5: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:6: trailing whitespace.
+  Background:
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:7: trailing whitespace.
+    Given the fixed synthetic green-v2 candidate has a healthy observation at tick 0
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:8: trailing whitespace.
+    And an observation is fresh only when its age is less than 2 synthetic ticks
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:9: trailing whitespace.
+    And blue-v1 holds all synthetic routing before promotion
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:10: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:11: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: An old green snapshot is safely rejected
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:12: trailing whitespace.
+    When the operator advances the configured 2 to 5 ticks
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:13: trailing whitespace.
+    And attempts promotion without revalidation
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:14: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the promotion outcome is FAILURE because the snapshot expired
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:15: trailing whitespace.
+    And candidate routing remains 0 percent
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:16: trailing whitespace.
+    And the stale healthy snapshot and blocked decision remain in the trace
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:17: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:18: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Fresh positive revalidation permits promotion
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:19: trailing whitespace.
+    Given the old green snapshot has expired
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:20: trailing whitespace.
+    When the operator revalidates with the healthy fixture
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:21: trailing whitespace.
+    And attempts promotion at the same synthetic tick
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:22: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the promotion outcome is SUCCESS with observation age 0
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:23: trailing whitespace.
+    And only synthetic candidate routing becomes 100 percent
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:24: trailing whitespace.
+    And actual user-transition outcome remains unverified
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:25: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:26: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Fresh negative revalidation does not inherit old green
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:27: trailing whitespace.
+    Given the old green snapshot has expired
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:28: trailing whitespace.
+    When the operator revalidates with the unhealthy fixture
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:29: trailing whitespace.
+    And attempts promotion
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:30: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the promotion outcome is FAILURE
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:31: trailing whitespace.
+    And candidate routing remains 0 percent
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:32: trailing whitespace.
+    And the original healthy observation cannot override the latest observation
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:33: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:34: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Missing revalidation cannot silently reuse the old snapshot
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:35: trailing whitespace.
+    Given the old green snapshot has expired
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:36: trailing whitespace.
+    When the operator revalidates with the missing fixture
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:37: trailing whitespace.
+    And attempts promotion
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:38: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the promotion outcome is UNKNOWN and is not SUCCESS
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:39: trailing whitespace.
+    And candidate routing remains 0 percent
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:40: trailing whitespace.
+    And no observation timestamp or health is invented
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:41: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:42: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Revalidation is not a permanent approval
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:43: trailing whitespace.
+    Given the operator has freshly revalidated the expired snapshot as healthy
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:44: trailing whitespace.
+    When the operator advances the configured ticks again before promotion
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:45: trailing whitespace.
+    And attempts promotion
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:46: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the refreshed observation is expired and the outcome is FAILURE
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:47: trailing whitespace.
+    And revalidation is required again outside this bounded attempt
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:48: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:49: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: The exact lifetime boundary is closed
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:50: trailing whitespace.
+    When observation age is 1 tick
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:51: trailing whitespace.
+    Then a healthy observation is fresh
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:52: trailing whitespace.
+    When observation age is exactly 2 ticks
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:53: trailing whitespace.
+    Then promotion is blocked as expired
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:54: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:55: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Results and predictions have separate denominators
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:56: trailing whitespace.
+    Given a stale promotion was blocked and fresh revalidation later permitted promotion
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:57: trailing whitespace.
+    When the operator checks a SUCCESS prediction
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:58: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the learning prediction is correct
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:59: trailing whitespace.
+    And both the failed and successful promotion decisions are retained
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:60: trailing whitespace.
+    And the historical failed decision is not rewritten as a success
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:61: trailing whitespace.
+    And a correct prediction of FAILURE is not a successful promotion
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:62: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:63: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: State and input guards reject without mutation
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:64: trailing whitespace.
+    When an input has an extra field, inherited value, accessor, unknown enum, or noninteger delay
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:65: trailing whitespace.
+    Or an action is repeated, out of order, or uses a changed observation without another decision
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:66: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the operation is rejected atomically
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:67: trailing whitespace.
+    And returned snapshots cannot mutate the model
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:68: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:69: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: A bounded keyboard-operated lesson retains history until explicit reset
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:70: trailing whitespace.
+    Given six attempts have been checked
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:71: trailing whitespace.
+    Then a seventh attempt cannot start and none is evicted
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:72: trailing whitespace.
+    And controls, errors, focus, history, and results are usable with Tab, Enter, and Space
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:73: trailing whitespace.
+    When the operator resets all local data
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:74: trailing whitespace.
+    Then inputs, clock, observations, predictions, errors, history, and counts return to defaults
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:75: trailing whitespace.
+    And reset does not shadow the native form reset method
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:76: trailing whitespace.
+
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:77: trailing whitespace.
+  Scenario: Verification stays local and does not rewrite proof
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:78: trailing whitespace.
+    Then the browser enforces local-only scripts and styles and blocks inline scripts, connections, frames, workers, and form submissions
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:79: trailing whitespace.
+    And ordinary test runs do not overwrite evidence
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:80: trailing whitespace.
+    And the published isolated browser helper is closed in an awaited finally
learning/S086/evidence/red/readiness.feature.snapshot:81: trailing whitespace.
+    And no native readiness, health, time, promotion, source-parent, or production Node24 certification is claimed
